<title>UK: IOC buys two Qua Iboe, one Palanca, no news on Dub.</title>
<headline>IOC buys two Qua Iboe, one Palanca, no news on Dub.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian Oil Corp has purchased two VLCCs of Nigerian Qua Iboe and one of Angolan Palanca crude in its tender for March deliveries, oil traders said.</p>
<p>IOC received five offers of Qua Iboe and one of Palanca.</p>
<p>Traders said it was not clear yet whether IOC also had purchased Dubai cargoes in its March tender.</p>
<p>At least five Dubai cargoes were offered.</p>
<p>--Richard Mably, London newsroom +44 171 542 8060</p>
</text>
